Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.36,0:24:32.49,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}どこにいでも行ける羽を
Dialogue: 1,0:24:32.16,0:24:34.74,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,1030)}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.91,0:24:36.41,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたに授けたの
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.41,0:24:43.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}どんな闇も晴らしてしまえるように
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.58,0:24:47.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}You gave me holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.55,0:24:52.13,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}恐れず進めよ　Oh holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.13,0:24:56.47,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}振り返ればいつも　Holy trace
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.47,0:25:00.60,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたが笑ってた
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.69,0:25:05.73,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}だから　Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.73,0:25:10.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}躓きながらでも　Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.23,0:25:14.61,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}私は踏み出せる　遠くへ
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.61,0:25:19.16,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}あなたがいる場所へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:52.07,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}所以不要擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.16,0:23:56.62,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}願不會被你察覺
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.66,0:24:01.50,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}願默默守護著你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.92,0:24:07.46,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}故事才剛剛拉開序幕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.59,0:24:10.22,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}縱使是在望不到盡頭的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.26,0:24:14.68,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}舉步維艱時也請相信
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.76,0:24:19.64,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}躊躇不定時也請相信
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.02,0:24:27.40,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}希望就在那裡 與我們相伴
Dialogue: 1,0:24:27.61,0:24:30.11,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,50)}我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.36,0:24:32.49,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}將能飛向萬千世界的羽翼
Dialogue: 1,0:24:32.16,0:24:34.74,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,50)}我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.91,0:24:36.41,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}授予你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.41,0:24:43.37,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}願它能助你劃破一切黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.58,0:24:47.55,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}你賜予了我神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.55,0:24:52.13,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}讓我不懼一切地前行 神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.13,0:24:56.47,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}每當回首都是條 光明之路
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.47,0:25:00.60,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}都有你的笑容相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.69,0:25:05.73,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}所以 神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.73,0:25:10.23,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}即便是幾經坎坷 神聖的勇氣
