Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.27,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}終わりが来たら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.27,0:00:05.52,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}なんて言おう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:08.65,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}どうせなら　ほら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:10.86,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}哀しくない様に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:16.74,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}いつかのあなたの言葉が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:19.24,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}酷く刺さってる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:25.08,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}温かく残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:35.93,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}知れば知るだけでいいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.93,0:00:38.10,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}何かを求めてしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:39.47,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}大丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.47,0:00:41.52,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}どこにも行かないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:43.60,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}どこにも行けないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:48.23,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}忘れないのに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:53.70,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}何故か遠くなる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.65,0:01:00.16,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}瞳の裏にいつも君は居る
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:04.62,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}今も　ずっとそう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.75,0:01:07.08,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}いつかね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:08.21,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}もう少しね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.21,0:01:12.51,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}世界に優しい風が吹いたら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.51,0:01:16.59,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}何か変わるのでしょうか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:19.26,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}「帰りたい場所がある」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:22.10,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}誰もがこの星の子孫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:23.56,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}約束はね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:24.98,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}大事にね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:29.36,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}温かく残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.27,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}倘若終結將降臨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.27,0:00:05.52,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}那該說些什麼才好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:08.65,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}倒不如像這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:10.86,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}裝作不曾悲傷的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:16.74,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}往昔你說過的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:19.24,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}深深地刺痛著
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:25.08,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}但溫暖猶存
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:35.93,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}明明知曉便已足夠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.93,0:00:38.10,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}卻總是渴求著更多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:39.47,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.47,0:00:41.52,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}我哪裡都不會去的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:43.60,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}其實我也無處可去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:48.23,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}分明從未遺忘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:53.70,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}卻為何漸行漸遠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.65,0:01:00.16,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}你始終存於我眼眸的深處
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:04.62,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}至今 一直如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.75,0:01:07.08,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}總有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:08.21,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}再稍等片刻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.21,0:01:12.51,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}如果世間吹起溫柔的風
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.51,0:01:16.59,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}是否會發生改變
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:19.26,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}「總有想要回去的地方」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:22.10,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}人人都是這顆星球的子孫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:23.56,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}而約定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:24.98,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}可要好好珍惜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:29.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}溫暖猶存
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:42.38,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}夜の隙間にあなたがいた
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:46.39,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}名前を呼んだ声がした
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:50.52,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}思い出せる何度だって
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.52,0:20:52.48,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}You were right here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:55.02,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}Right here with me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:21:02.86,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}そう、心臓から指先まで
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:06.87,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}あなたに触れたい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:10.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}守りたい　隣にいたい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:18.38,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}また会う日まで　なんて行く宛もないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:25.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}その足跡をまた　たどっていた
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:30.39,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}誰よりも　あなたに言えるように
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.39,0:21:34.39,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}どこでも　あなたに見えるように
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.39,0:21:42.32,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}雨の日もずっと　灯してた光を
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:46.36,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}いつかは　闇を晴らすように
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:50.49,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}あなたに　この手届くように
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.49,0:21:58.84,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FOT-TelopMin Pro D\frz-90\an1\pos(0,15)\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs45}言葉にしないでおいて
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:42.38,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}你的身影就在夜幕的縫隙間
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:46.39,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}我聽見了呼喚自己的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:50.52,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}無論多少次 我都能回憶起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.52,0:20:52.48,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}你就在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:55.02,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}就陪伴在我身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:21:02.86,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}是啊 從心臟直到指尖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:06.87,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}我想要觸碰到你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:10.37,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}守護著你 陪伴著你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:18.38,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}雖然在相逢之前 仍是飄零浮沉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:25.55,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}我也依舊會沿著那熟悉的足跡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:30.39,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}為了能夠比誰都更加堅定地說出
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.39,0:21:34.39,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}為了不管在何處都能讓你望到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.39,0:21:42.32,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}在雨夜中也會一直舉著燈火
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:46.36,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}願總有一天能夠照亮黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:50.49,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}願能夠傳遞到你的手中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.49,0:21:58.84,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准雅宋_GBK\frz-90\an9\fad(500,500)\blur2\fs37\pos(1915,1070)}願這一切都不止於言語
